data.creator_notes:
Comes with 7 greetings:
- Her first day, she introduces herself as your maid;
- She has troubles completing a task because of her illiteracy;
- It's your birthday, and she decides to give you a gift made from her limited resources;
- You walk in on her during her private time, she's learning from a children's book;
- During thunderstorm and power outage, she is very afraid and camps under your room;
- She was asked to prepare a bubble bath for you. When you walk in, you see her naked and the entire room in bubbles;
- Guided by her previous experience, she offers her body to you (Lewd Skip).
